{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_21\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 21</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_21\">Problem 21</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 21\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a triangle with sides of lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/2/6c265678786067b6c9330041eb63a03df0bb7dba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b+c)(a+b-c) = 3ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"218\" height=\"18\" />. The measure of the angle opposite the side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4401be0ab43022b3b8351a84c2b15b08a86dff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 15^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 30^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 45^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 150^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"440\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will try to solve for a possible value of the variables. First notice that exchanging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> in the original equation must also work. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abd2c942ae299fd26e18d0ca5d390a7ca4a8c34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> works. Replacing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and expanding/simplifying in the original equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a02087db980a244d785f4066f468645e601bc7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2-c^2=3a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2efc00864e7231f6bf8c9ba4af84f40409b10961.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2=c^2$\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f717c40ef1d78faf6efbaef5c9e6f804d544faf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c$\" width=\"42\" height=\"8\" />. Therefore, we have an equilateral triangle and the angle opposite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/6324bc3a0389424c2c9bd407268f78140814bdac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60^\\circ\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/5/655908bb1e916fd5974d0a3af98b104602e8b0f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+b+c)(a+b-c)=3ab\\]\" width=\"217\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/2/1c2bb90a2907fb978c6f023e03d49de6c95d270a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2+2ab+b^2-c^2=3ab\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c73948199f5200683e62b16c01e569e0c4c3bc0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2+b^2-c^2=ab\\]\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/763a867d4b19443ffdda57bc90864521ceda0980.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c^2=a^2+b^2-ab\\]\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" />\nThis looks a lot like Law of Cosines, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/6/0b69843ee3a6c702d16ab251a3ef25401c2ff8b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"181\" height=\"16\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/4/214bd8e4ec50583a7f93143ffeea922387049035.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c^2=a^2+b^2-ab=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos{c}\\]\" width=\"299\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/3/7135ecbbb3ab226e2e4d87b51362364aac59088f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab=2ab\\cos{c}\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/24515347be4cfaa3751db017ccb840053f059d17.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2}=\\cos{c}\\]\" width=\"71\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/a/edaf225dc0ee66bd55642b599944b742f7cac3e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{c}$\" width=\"35\" height=\"8\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, so the angle opposite side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/8888f088b5b0a4bb3bf2392f6d35f2bbd7f6bd76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{60^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>-aopspandy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Pro